@model MyVoltage.Models.OperationalModels.J_Finance.J_FinanceModels.J_Finance_JournalSagepayRelease_DetailsModel
@inject MyVoltage.Services.OperationalProvider operationalProvider;
@using MyVoltage.Extensions;
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = $"{MyVoltage.Data.SecureAreaEnum.J_Finance_JournalSagepayRelease_Details.GetDescription()} - {operationalProvider.CompanyName}";
}

<div class="row mb-4">
    <div class="col">
        <div class="card p-md-4 mv-gradient">
            @if (operationalProvider.CompanyID == 0)
            {
                <div class="card-header">
                </div>
                <div class="card-body">
                    Select company to start...
                </div>
                <div class="card-footer">
                </div>
            }
            else
            {
                if (Model.IsSuccess)
                {
                    <div class="card-header">
                        Success!
                    </div>
                    <div class="card-body">
                        Journal successfully added.
                    </div>
                    <div class="card-footer">
                        <div class="row">
                            <div class="col">
                                <a href="/Operational/J_Finance/J_Finance_JournalSagepayRelease_Details" class="btn btn-outline-primary"><i class="fas fa-plus-circle"></i>&nbsp;Capture New</a>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col">
                                <a href="/operational/J_Finance/J_Finance_JournalSagepayRelease_Summary" class="btn btn-outline-primary"><i class="fas fa-chevron-left"></i>&nbsp;Back To List</a>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                }
                else
                {
                    <div class="card-header">
                    </div>
                    <div class="card-body">
                        <form asp-action="J_Finance_JournalSagepayRelease_Details" enctype="multipart/form-data">

                            <div class="row mb-2 mt-2">
                                <div class="col">
                                    <label class="label">Company</label>
                                </div>
                                <div class="col">
                                    @operationalProvider.CompanyName
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <div class="row mb-2 mt-2">
                                <div class="col">
                                    <label class="label" asp-for="SkybillSagepayBalance"></label>
                                </div>
                                <div class="col">
                                    @Model.SkybillSagepayBalance.ToMoneyNoDecimal()
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <div class="row mb-2 mt-2">
                                <div class="col">
                                    <label class="label" asp-for="Amount"></label>
                                </div>
                                <div class="col">
                                    <input type="text" class="form-control" asp-for="Amount" />
                                    <span asp-validation-for="Amount"></span>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            @if (!string.IsNullOrEmpty(Model.ErrorMessage))
                            {
                                <div class="row mb-2 mt-2">
                                    <div class="col-12 text-red font-weight-bold">
                                        @Model.ErrorMessage
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            }

                            <div class="row mb-2 mt-2">
                                <div class="col-12 text-right">
                                    <button type="submit" class="btn btn-outline-primary float-right"><i class="fas fa-save"></i>&nbsp;Save</button>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                        </form>
                    </div>
                    <div class="card-footer">
                    </div>
                }
            }
        </div>

    </div>
</div>
